WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.268
-Guys, we have
exactly 11 shows left

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.469
before we go on Christmas break,

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:04.503
which means it's time

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:06.172
for that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:09.409
It's time for
"12 Days of Christmas Sweaters!"

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:10.577
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.612
-♪ 12 days of
Christmas sweaters ♪

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:16.516
♪ 11 days left ♪

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.518
-That's right.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:20.920
Every show
between now and Christmas,

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.722
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:25.125
a stupendous Christmas sweater

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.893
from the Countdown to Christmas
cabinet.

00:00:27.893 --> 00:00:30.596
Now since there are
11 shows left,

00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:34.433
let's open door number 11!

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.736
I'll let you do it.
I'll let you do it.

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:38.471
Okay. Oh, my!

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:39.639
Now, come on!

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:41.674 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.276
Let's see what it is.
Oh, my goodness.

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:44.644
Sure, sure, yeah.

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:46.712
That is un-- No one has
something like that.

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:48.281
Look at that thing.
A frog.

00:00:49.114 --> 00:00:50.349
Good Lord!

00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:51.785
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:53.219
Good.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.720
Wow!

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.021
Well, how about the back?

00:00:56.021 --> 00:00:57.823
Ooh. [ Laughs ]

00:00:57.823 --> 00:01:00.159
Oh, yeah!
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:02.461
Let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:01:02.461 --> 00:01:04.830
Some lucky person is going to go
home in that sweater.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.566
Everyone, look
at your seat number, okay?

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.568
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.069
Quest, can I get a drum roll,
please?

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:14.507
[ Drum roll ]

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:17.543
257!

00:01:17.543 --> 00:01:19.378 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:21.647
Come on down!

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:22.916
You're going the long way?

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.084
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:32.525 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:33.526
Welcome!

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.761
Go over that way.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.362
Nice to see you!

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.764
Oh, yeah. Hi, welcome.
How are you?

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:42.402
I love that you're three seats
from that way.

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:44.971
But you're one
of those people.

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:47.440
You're one of those people that
got up and made 12 people move.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:51.043
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.043 --> 00:01:52.278
Hi, what is your name?

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.781
-I'm Xibo.
I'm from China.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.683
-No way! Welcome!
Thank you for being here.

00:01:56.683 --> 00:01:57.584
-Thank you.

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:58.984
-You see our show in China?

00:01:58.984 --> 00:02:02.222
-Yeah like, back in China,
I started watching your show.

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:04.657
-I'm so excited.
I'm so happy that you're here.

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.726
I love the sweater you have on,
but I think --

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:08.227
-Should I put it on now?

00:02:08.227 --> 00:02:09.461
-I think you should.

00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:10.663
Yeah, I really do.
I really do.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:13.232
I think this is --
it's a special --

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:16.869
Yes. Yes!
That's exactly right!

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:18.804 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:18.804 --> 00:02:21.107
[ Laughs ]
Oh, it's so good.

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:22.942
It's so good.
It's so good.

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:24.677
[ Laughing ]
Oh, my goodness!

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.379
Get her hair!
Get her hair.

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:28.381
Oh, look at --

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:30.583
Oh, my God, look at this!
Are you kidding me?

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:32.785
[ Cheers and applause ]
Let me see.

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:35.321
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:37.123
[ Laughs ]

00:02:37.123 --> 00:02:39.392
You make it look cute.
-Thank you.

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:40.593
-You make it look cute.

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:42.595
Let's give our winner
a round of applause.

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:45.298
Thank you for coming
all the way from China.

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:47.500
You can go up that side.
It's much faster, yeah.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.801
Stick around --
we're playing "Password"

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:51.103
with Tyler Perry and
Michael Bublé after the break.

00:02:51.103 --> 00:02:52.238
Come on back.

00:02:52.238 --> 00:03:00.713 line:0%
♪♪

